  "translation": "Na king i tok: Han bilong Yoab, ⟨את⟩ i stap wantaim yu long olgeta dispela samting? Na meri i tok bek, i tok: Long laip bilong bel bilong yu, bikman bilong mi king — sapos i gat man i ken go long han sut o long han kais, i go we long olgeta we bikman bilong mi king i tok; bilong wokman bilong yu Yoab, em i givim tok mi, na em i putim ⟨את⟩ olgeta ol dispela tok long maus bilong meri bilong yu.",
